{"n":2,"title":"Two hellos","blurb":"By the end you can greet people (formal and informal), say goodbye, introduce yourself and ask someone's name.","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Quick recall from Lesson 1. Choose, then check.","sub":"Здесь нет правильного ответа","options":[{"label":"I like"},{"label":"I don’t like"},{"label":"Slowly"},{"label":"I like"},{"label":"I don’t like"},{"label":"Slowly"},{"label":"Slowly"},{"label":"Quickly"},{"label":"Slowlys"},{"label":"I like"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"hello","pos":"","ru":"привет","kk":"сәлем","def":"the word you say when you meet someone","img":"/course/a0/img/l2-hello.jpg"},{"en":"hi","pos":"","ru":"привет","kk":"сәлем","def":"a short, friendly way to say hello","img":"/course/a0/img/l2-hi.jpg"},{"en":"good morning","pos":"","ru":"доброе утро","kk":"қайырлы таң","def":"the greeting for the early part of the day","img":"/course/a0/img/l2-good-morning.jpg"},{"en":"goodbye","pos":"","ru":"до свидания","kk":"сау болыңыз","def":"the word you say when you leave","img":"/course/a0/img/l2-goodbye.jpg"},{"en":"see you later","pos":"","ru":"увидимся","kk":"кездескенше","def":"a friendly goodbye when you will meet again","img":"/course/a0/img/l2-see-you-later.jpg"},{"en":"nice to meet you","pos":"","ru":"приятно познакомиться","kk":"танысқаныма қуаныштымын","def":"polite words you say when you meet a person for the first time","img":"/course/a0/img/l2-nice-to-meet-you.jpg"},{"en":"name","pos":"","ru":"имя, фамилия","kk":"есім","def":"the word that people call you, for example Anna","img":"/course/a0/img/l2-name.jpg"},{"en":"thanks","pos":"","ru":"спасибо","kk":"рахмет","def":"a word you say when someone helps you","img":"/course/a0/img/l2-thanks.jpg"},{"en":"too","pos":"","ru":"тоже","kk":"да, тағы","def":"also; as well — Nice to meet you too","img":null},{"en":"This is…","pos":"","ru":"это…","kk":"бұл…","d